      "line": 49,
      "text": "The paper proves the all-orders chordal bound c₄(G) ≤ floor(n(n+1)/6) + b"
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "text": "for an absolute constant, and the sharp eventual maximum. It also treats"
    },
